      "text": "I am directed to forward herewith Provisional Seniority List of Lower Grade\nClerks of AC Cadre of this Administration, with the request to circulate the same\namongst the LGCs working in your department/ establishment including those who\nhave been posted in subordinate and out station offices, and claim and objections, if\nany, received from them, may be forwarded to the Administration immediately but not\nlater than 21/09/2026."
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "text",
      "order": 7,
      "poly": [
        82.71,
        394.06,
        532.52,
        394.06,
        532.52,
        467.31,
        82.71,
        467.31
      ],
      "text": "A compliance report regarding circulation of the provisional seniority list\namongst the concerned LGCs of your dept. / office may be furnished to this\nAdministration within the aforesaid period and in case no representation is received\nfrom any of the LGCs working in the office the same may also be confirmed by the\ndate indicated above."
    },
